# Press NOTHING. Let the logos and the intro animation play out.
#
# Every other schedule here fires START at t=12, which SKIPS the logos -- that
# is what new_game.pad exists to do and what makes an unattended run reach
# gameplay. The consequence went unnoticed for a whole session: not one capture
# taken today contains the intro animation, because every one of them skipped
# it. When the user reports the intro stuttering, there was no data.
#
# So: no events at all. The file is deliberately empty of presses, and it is a
# file rather than an empty RECOMP_PAD_SCRIPT so that the intent is written
# down somewhere a reader will find it.
#
# Run long enough to cover logos + attract; 90 s is comfortable.
